      <activity id="5a886652-350c-5273-b6a0-e021c21a079b" activityNameId="9202132d-3f7c-5c51-9042-843155f82bfd" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Furnace, wood chips, hardwood, 50kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Furnace, wood chips, hardwood, 50kW
Inventory refers to the production of a wood chips furnace 50kW. Composition of the previous inventory was used and updated with the average weight of current wood chips furnaces available in Switzerland.\nTechnology: average technology\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Holzenergie\nLocal subcategory: Heizungssysteme\nUVEK 2022 source file:EcoSpold_furnace_wood chips_50kW_v0.3_lwa.xml\n\n
UUID: b923cec8-edb7-36cc-a93d-868a50b5ec9c
Includes materials, transports and energy used for the fabrication of the furnace, the chimney, the storage silo, the automatic fuel supply and the automatic control technique.
Location: undefined
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b923cec8-edb7-36cc-a93d-868a50b5ec9c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
